    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d443">

                <pb facs="0748" n="730" xml:id="pg730"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.2365/11–2847: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Embassy in Italy
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-11-29T14:00:00-05:00">November 29,
                            1947—2 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2482. For the Ambassador. Decision set forth Deptel 2473 Nov 28<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d443-f1"/> taken on basis National Security Council recommendations
                    approved by President<anchor n="2" xml:id="d443-f2"/> for support Ital Govt
                    during next few crucial months, copy of which being sent you by courier. Upon
                    receipt please cable your comments or suggestions soonest.</p>
                <p>In informing De Gasperi above decision, you shd say this action may possibly
                    result in few days’ delay troop withdrawal beyond treaty date, owning logistic
                    difficulties, and we expect therefore Ital Govt will accept this notification as
                    justification thereof if delay materializes.</p>
                <p>You shd add that while we have been glad comply with De Gasperi’s request in this
                    instance, we are wondering what contingencies he envisages after Dec 15 (ref
                    Willems msg from London<anchor n="3" xml:id="d443-f3"/>) and what Ital Govt’s
                    plans may be for coping with situation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d443-f1" n="1" xml:id="d443-f1-content">
                <p>See footnote 2, <ref target="#pg729">p. 729</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d443-f2" n="2" xml:id="d443-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#pg724">p. 724</ref>, and footnote 3.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d443-f3" n="3" xml:id="d443-f3-content">
                <p>The message from London from Col. John M. Willems, Military Attaché of the
                    Embassy in Italy, has not been identified.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
